LEMMA V21_SFollowOff ==
 ASSUME Sizes, Location, Design
 PROVE
                        SFollow => (~B2 => UNCHANGED sV)
 BY ONLY SMTT(5), Sizes, Location, Design DEF SFollow, Sizes, Location, Design

LEMMA V21_SFollowStatic ==
 ASSUME Sizes, Location, Design
 PROVE
 SFollow => UNCHANGED <<sown,sgen,skey,swrite,sdata,sready,hitSeen,dedupSeen>>
 BY ONLY SMTT(5), Sizes, Location, Design DEF SFollow, sV, Sizes, Location, Design

LEMMA V21_PEndNet ==
 ASSUME Sizes, Location, Design,
        NEW i \in Inst, NEW r \in Rq, NEW how, PEnd(i,r,how)
 PROVE \A m \in net' : m \in net \/ m.t="abort" \/ (m.t="nopost" /\ m.x \in Xids)
<1> DEFINE V21_Cancel == ph[i][r]="reg" /\ rx[i][r] \in Xids
                         /\ iv[rx[i][r]]="reg" /\ Mut # "pEndNoCancel"
<1> HIDE DEF V21_Cancel
<1>1. V21_Cancel => rx[i][r] \in Xids
 BY ONLY SMTT(5), Sizes, Location, Design DEF V21_Cancel, Sizes, Location, Design
<1>2. net' = net \cup {Msg("abort",i,rpe[i][r],r,rg[i][r],0,0,0,FALSE)}
           \cup (IF V21_Cancel
                 THEN {Msg("nopost",i,xd[rx[i][r]],r,xg[rx[i][r]],rx[i][r],0,0,FALSE)}
                 ELSE {})
 BY SMTT(5), Sizes, Location, Design DEF PEnd, V21_Cancel, Sizes, Location, Design
<1>3. QED BY ONLY <1>1, <1>2, SMTT(5), Sizes, Location, Design DEF Msg, Sizes, Location, Design

LEMMA V21_MsgDomainTransfer ==
 ASSUME Sizes, Location, Design,
        MsgXDomain,
        \A m \in net' : m \in net \/ m.t="abort" \/ (m.t="nopost" /\ m.x \in Xids)
 PROVE MsgXDomain'
 BY SMTT(5), Sizes, Location, Design DEF MsgXDomain, Sizes, Location, Design


LEMMA V22_SFollowSharedOrigin ==
 ASSUME NEW p \in SPages, B2, SFollow, spst'[p]="shared"
 PROVE spst[p]="shared"
 BY ONLY B2, SFollow, spst'[p]="shared", SMTT(5) DEF SFollow
====
